{%- from "brand.njk" import img with context -%}
{#
  Draft with AI as App Store screenshot 03 shows it: three requests made of one
  lasagna, each on a slip of the conversation's own paper with two lines of
  FlavorDraft's answer. The person speaks in the app's red bubble and
  FlavorDraft answers on the page. Each slip is an excerpt of a real capture (two
  strips of one screen, scripts/screens.json), from the requests the campaign
  approved; nothing is retyped, and the site draws no ink of its own over the app.
  On wider screens the slips are set first, on the left (home.css), so the section
  reads from the page to the words; the heading stays first in the markup.
#}
<section class="draft" aria-labelledby="draft-title">
  <div class="wrap draft__grid">
    <div class="draft__copy">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="draft-title">Make recipes fit&nbsp;you.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Ask Draft with AI for what you want, in your own words: healthier, higher in protein, lower in sodium, enough for six.</p>
      <p class="lede">It answers on the page, then marks up the recipe like an editor: what goes is struck through, what’s new is written in. Nothing changes until you choose Apply Changes.</p>
    </div>

    <figure class="draft__slips">
      <ul class="draft__notes" role="list" aria-label="Three requests made of a lasagna recipe">
        <li class="paper-sheet">{{ img("draft-healthier", "Make it healthier. FlavorDraft: use lean beef and pork mince, or swap half (or all) for ground turkey or chicken; reduce the pancetta or bacon to 40g, or use a leaner ham.", "(min-width: 72em) 422px, (min-width: 62em) 37vw, (min-width: 48em) 44vw, (min-width: 34em) 461px, 86vw") }}</li>
        <li class="paper-sheet">{{ img("draft-protein", "Make this higher in protein. FlavorDraft: increase the total meat to 1.2 kg (for example, 600g beef and 600g pork, turkey or chicken); add 1 to 2 cups of cooked lentils for extra plant-based protein and fibre.", "(min-width: 72em) 422px, (min-width: 62em) 37vw, (min-width: 48em) 44vw, (min-width: 34em) 461px, 86vw") }}</li>
        <li class="paper-sheet">{{ img("draft-sodium", "Make this lower in sodium. FlavorDraft: use low-sodium or salt-free canned tomatoes and tomato paste; use unsalted butter and low-fat or skim milk in the cheese sauce.", "(min-width: 72em) 422px, (min-width: 62em) 37vw, (min-width: 48em) 44vw, (min-width: 34em) 461px, 86vw") }}</li>
      </ul>
      <figcaption class="caption">Three requests made of one lasagna, and two lines of each answer.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
